    "Continue a recent conversation": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continue a recent conversation"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"继续最近的对话"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"繼續最近的對話"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar uma conversa recente"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine kürzlich geführte Unterhaltung fortsetzen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuar una conversación reciente"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最近の会話を続ける"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"최근 대화 계속하기"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuer une conversation récente"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"हाल की बातचीत जारी रखें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"متابعة محادثة حديثة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continua una conversazione recente"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yakın tarihli bir konuşmaya devam et"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продовжити нещодавню розмову"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lanjutkan percakapan terbaru"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontynuuj ostatnią rozmowę"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"สนทนาต่อล่าสุด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiếp tục một cuộc trò chuyện gần đây"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Een recent gesprek voortzetten"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ادامه یک گفت‌وگوی اخیر"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Продолжить недавний разговор"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fortsätt en nyligen använd konversation"}}}},
    "Continuously copy this Mac's logged-in cookies for the domains below into the remote OpenClaw browser profile. Off by default.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Continuously copy this Mac's logged-in cookies for the domains below into the remote OpenClaw browser profile. Off by default."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"持续将本 Mac 上以下域名的已登录 Cookie 复制到远程 OpenClaw 浏览器配置中。默认关闭。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"持續將此 Mac 上已登入的 Cookie（限下列網域）複製到遠端 OpenClaw 瀏覽器設定檔。預設為關閉。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia continuamente os cookies deste Mac das sessões conectadas para os domínios abaixo no perfil de navegador remoto do OpenClaw. Desativado por padrão."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiert kontinuierlich die auf diesem Mac angemeldeten Cookies für die untenstehenden Domains in das Remote-OpenClaw-Browserprofil. Standardmäßig deaktiviert."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia continuamente las cookies de sesión de este Mac para los dominios indicados abajo en el perfil del navegador remoto de OpenClaw. Desactivado de forma predeterminada."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"以下のドメインについて、このMacのログイン済みCookieを継続的にリモートのOpenClawブラウザプロファイルへコピーします。デフォルトはオフです。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에 로그인된 아래 도메인의 쿠키를 원격 OpenClaw 브라우저 프로필로 계속 복사합니다. 기본적으로 꺼져 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copie en continu les cookies de connexion de ce Mac pour les domaines ci-dessous dans le profil de navigateur OpenClaw distant. Désactivé par défaut."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"इस Mac के लॉग-इन किए गए कुकीज़ को नीचे दिए गए डोमेन के लिए रिमोट OpenClaw ब्राउज़र प्रोफ़ाइल में निरंतर कॉपी करें। डिफ़ॉल्ट रूप से बंद।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نسخ ملفات تعريف الارتباط المسجَّل دخولها على هذا الـ Mac للنطاقات أدناه باستمرار إلى ملف تعريف متصفح OpenClaw البعيد. معطّل افتراضيًا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copia continuamente i cookie di accesso di questo Mac per i domini indicati sotto nel profilo browser remoto di OpenClaw. Disattivato per impostazione predefinita."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac'in aşağıdaki alan adları için oturum açmış çerezlerini uzaktaki OpenClaw tarayıcı profiline sürekli olarak kopyalayın. Varsayılan olarak kapalıdır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Безперервно копіювати cookie-файли автентифікованих сеансів цього Mac для наведених нижче доменів у віддалений профіль браузера OpenClaw. За замовчуванням вимкнено."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terus menyalin cookie yang masuk dari Mac ini untuk domain di bawah ke profil browser OpenClaw jarak jauh. Nonaktif secara default."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ciągle kopiuj pliki cookie zalogowanego użytkownika tego Maca dla poniższych domen do zdalnego profilu przeglądarki OpenClaw. Domyślnie wyłączone."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คัดลอกคุกกี้ที่ล็อกอินของ Mac เครื่องนี้สำหรับโดเมนด้านล่างไปยังโปรไฟล์เบราว์เซอร์ OpenClaw ระยะไกลอย่างต่อเนื่อง ปิดใช้งานตามค่าเริ่มต้น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Liên tục sao chép cookie đã đăng nhập của máy Mac này cho các miền bên dưới vào hồ sơ trình duyệt OpenClaw từ xa. Mặc định tắt."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopieer voortdurend de ingelogde cookies van deze Mac voor onderstaande domeinen naar het externe OpenClaw-browserprofiel. Standaard uit."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کوکی‌های ورود این مک را برای دامنه‌های زیر به‌طور پیوسته در نمایه مرورگر راه‌دور OpenClaw کپی می‌کند. به‌طور پیش‌فرض خاموش است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Непрерывно копировать cookie авторизованных сессий на этом Mac для указанных ниже доменов в удалённый профиль браузера OpenClaw. По умолчанию отключено."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiera kontinuerligt de inloggade cookiesar från denna Mac för domänerna nedan till den fjärranslutna OpenClaw-webbläsarprofilen. Av som standard."}}}},
    "Control Terminal for automation actions; other apps request access separately": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control Terminal for automation actions; other apps request access separately"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制 Terminal 以执行自动化操作；其他应用需单独请求访问权限"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制 Terminal 以執行自動化動作；其他應用程式須另行請求存取權"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controle o Terminal para ações de automação; outros apps solicitam acesso separadamente"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminal für Automatisierungsaktionen steuern; andere Apps fordern Zugriff separat an"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla Terminal para acciones de automatización; otras apps solicitan acceso por separado"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自動化アクション用にTerminalを制御します。他のアプリは個別にアクセスを要求します"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"자동화 작업을 위해 Terminal을 제어합니다. 다른 앱은 별도로 액세스를 요청합니다"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôler Terminal pour les actions d'automatisation ; les autres applications demandent l'accès séparément"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"स्वचालन क्रियाओं के लिए Terminal को नियंत्रित करें; अन्य ऐप्स अलग से एक्सेस का अनुरोध करते हैं"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تحكّم في Terminal لإجراءات الأتمتة؛ تطلب التطبيقات الأخرى الوصول بشكل منفصل"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla il Terminale per le azioni di automazione; le altre app richiedono l'accesso separatamente"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Otomasyon işlemleri için Terminal'i denetleyin; diğer uygulamalar erişimi ayrıca ister"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керуйте Terminal для дій автоматизації; інші застосунки запитують доступ окремо"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol Terminal untuk tindakan otomatisasi; aplikasi lain meminta akses secara terpisah"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroluj Terminal dla działań automatyzacji; inne aplikacje żądają dostępu osobno"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุม Terminal สำหรับการดำเนินการอัตโนมัติ แอปอื่นๆ ขอสิทธิ์การเข้าถึงแยกต่างหาก"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển Terminal cho các hành động tự động hóa; các ứng dụng khác yêu cầu quyền truy cập riêng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bedien Terminal voor automatiseringsacties; andere apps vragen afzonderlijk om toegang"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کنترل Terminal برای اقدامات خودکارسازی؛ سایر برنامه‌ها دسترسی را جداگانه درخواست می‌کنند"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управлять Terminal для действий автоматизации; другие приложения запрашивают доступ отдельно"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr Terminal för automationsåtgärder; andra appar begär åtkomst separat"}}}},
    "Control UI elements when an action requires it": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control UI elements when an action requires it"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在操作需要时控制 UI 元素"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在動作需要時控制 UI 元素"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar elementos da Control UI quando uma ação exigir"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UI-Elemente steuern, wenn eine Aktion dies erfordert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlar elementos de la Control UI cuando una acción lo requiera"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"アクションで必要な場合に UI 要素を制御"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"작업에 필요한 경우 UI 요소 제어"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôler les éléments de Control UI lorsqu’une action l’exige"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जब किसी क्रिया के लिए आवश्यक हो, UI तत्वों को नियंत्रित करें"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التحكم في عناصر Control UI عندما يتطلب الإجراء ذلك"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla gli elementi dell’interfaccia quando un’azione lo richiede"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bir eylem gerektirdiğinde Control UI öğelerini kontrol et"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керувати елементами Control UI, коли цього вимагає дія"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol elemen UI saat suatu tindakan memerlukannya"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sterowanie elementami Control UI, gdy wymaga tego działanie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมองค์ประกอบ UI เมื่อการทำงานจำเป็นต้องใช้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển các thành phần Control UI khi một thao tác yêu cầu"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"UI-elementen bedienen wanneer een actie dit vereist"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کنترل عناصر Control UI هنگامی که یک اقدام به آن نیاز دارد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управление элементами Control UI, когда это требуется для действия"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr UI-element när en åtgärd kräver det"}}}},
    "Control channel": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control channel"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制通道"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制通道"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de controle"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuerkanal"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de control"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"制御チャネル"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"제어 채널"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canal de contrôle"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नियंत्रण चैनल"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"قناة التحكم"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Canale di controllo"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol kanalı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Канал керування"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Saluran kontrol"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kanał sterowania"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ช่องทางควบคุม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kênh điều khiển"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Besturingskanaal"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کانال کنترل"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Канал управления"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrollkanal"}}}},
    "Control how agent shell commands are approved on this Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Control how agent shell commands are approved on this Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制此 Mac 上代理 shell 命令的审批方式。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制這台 Mac 上代理程式 Shell 命令的核准方式。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controle como os comandos de shell do agente são aprovados neste Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuern Sie, wie Agent-Shell-Befehle auf diesem Mac genehmigt werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla cómo se aprueban los comandos de shell del agente en esta Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この Mac でエージェントのシェルコマンドをどのように承認するかを制御します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 Mac에서 에이전트 셸 명령 승인 방식을 제어합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôlez la façon dont les commandes shell de l’agent sont approuvées sur ce Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नियंत्रित करें कि इस Mac पर agent shell commands को कैसे अनुमोदित किया जाता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تحكّم في كيفية الموافقة على أوامر صدفة الوكيل على هذا الـ Mac."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla come vengono approvati i comandi shell dell’agente su questo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bu Mac'te ajan kabuk komutlarının nasıl onaylanacağını kontrol edin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керуйте тим, як схвалюються команди оболонки агента на цьому Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol cara perintah shell agen disetujui di Mac ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroluj, jak zatwierdzane są polecenia powłoki agenta na tym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมวิธีอนุมัติคำสั่งเชลล์ของเอเจนต์บน Mac เครื่องนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kiểm soát cách phê duyệt các lệnh shell của agent trên máy Mac này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bepaal hoe shell-opdrachten van agenten op deze Mac worden goedgekeurd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نحوهٔ تأیید فرمان‌های پوستهٔ عامل را در این Mac کنترل کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управляйте тем, как на этом Mac подтверждаются команды оболочки агента."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr hur agentens skalkommandon godkänns på denna Mac."}}}},
    "Controls": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controls"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制項"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controles"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuerelemente"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controles"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"コントロール"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"컨트롤"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôles"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"नियंत्रण"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"عناصر التحكم"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlli"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroller"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Елементи керування"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontrol"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elementy sterujące"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การควบคุม"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Điều khiển"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bedieningselementen"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کنترل‌ها"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Элементы управления"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontroller"}}}},
    "Controls the macOS app log verbosity.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controls the macOS app log verbosity."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制 macOS App 日志的详细程度。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"控制 macOS app 記錄的詳細程度。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla a verbosidade do log do app macOS."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Steuert die Ausführlichkeit des macOS-App-Protokolls."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controla el nivel de detalle del registro de la app de macOS."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOSアプリログの詳細度を制御します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS 앱 로그 상세 수준을 제어합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Contrôle le niveau de détail du journal de l’app macOS."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS ऐप लॉग वर्बोसिटी को नियंत्रित करता है."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يتحكم في مستوى تفصيل سجل تطبيق macOS."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Controlla il livello di dettaglio del log dell'app macOS."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"macOS uygulama günlüğü ayrıntı düzeyini kontrol eder."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Керує докладністю журналу програми macOS."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mengontrol tingkat verbosity log aplikasi macOS."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Określa szczegółowość dziennika aplikacji macOS."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ควบคุมระดับรายละเอียดของบันทึกแอป macOS"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kiểm soát mức độ chi tiết của nhật ký ứng dụng macOS."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bepaalt het detailniveau van het macOS-app-log."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سطح جزئیات گزارش برنامه macOS را کنترل می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Управляет уровнем подробности журнала приложения macOS."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Styr detaljnivån för macOS-appens loggning."}}}},
    "Cookie sync": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie sync"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie 同步"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie 同步"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sincronização de cookies"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie-Synchronisierung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sincronización de cookies"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie同期"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"쿠키 동기화"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Synchronisation des cookies"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कुकी सिंक"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مزامنة ملفات تعريف الارتباط"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sincronizzazione cookie"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çerez eşitleme"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Синхронізація cookie"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sinkronisasi cookie"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Synchronizacja plików cookie"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การซิงค์คุกกี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đồng bộ cookie"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookiesynchronisatie"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همگام‌سازی کوکی"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Синхронизация cookie"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookiesynkronisering"}}}},
    "Cookie sync applies when OpenClaw runs on another computer (remote mode).": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie sync applies when OpenClaw runs on another computer (remote mode)."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie 同步在 OpenClaw 于另一台计算机上运行（远程模式）时生效。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie 同步會在 OpenClaw 於其他電腦上執行（遠端模式）時套用。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A sincronização de cookies se aplica quando o OpenClaw é executado em outro computador (modo remoto)."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Die Cookie-Synchronisierung gilt, wenn OpenClaw auf einem anderen Computer läuft (Remote-Modus)."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La sincronización de cookies se aplica cuando OpenClaw se ejecuta en otro equipo (modo remoto)."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie同期は、OpenClawが別のコンピュータで実行される場合（リモートモード）に適用されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"쿠키 동기화는 OpenClaw가 다른 컴퓨터에서 실행될 때(원격 모드) 적용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La synchronisation des cookies s'applique lorsque OpenClaw s'exécute sur un autre ordinateur (mode distant)."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कुकी सिंक तब लागू होता है जब OpenClaw किसी अन्य कंप्यूटर पर चलता है (रिमोट मोड)।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تنطبق مزامنة ملفات تعريف الارتباط عندما يعمل OpenClaw على جهاز آخر (الوضع البعيد)."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La sincronizzazione dei cookie si applica quando OpenClaw viene eseguito su un altro computer (modalità remota)."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çerez eşitleme, OpenClaw başka bir bilgisayarda (uzak mod) çalıştığında geçerlidir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Синхронізація cookie застосовується, коли OpenClaw працює на іншому комп'ютері (віддалений режим)."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sinkronisasi cookie berlaku saat OpenClaw berjalan di komputer lain (mode jarak jauh)."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Synchronizacja plików cookie działa, gdy OpenClaw jest uruchamiany na innym komputerze (tryb zdalny)."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การซิงค์คุกกี้จะใช้เมื่อ OpenClaw ทำงานบนคอมพิวเตอร์เครื่องอื่น (โหมดระยะไกล)"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đồng bộ cookie áp dụng khi OpenClaw chạy trên máy tính khác (chế độ từ xa)."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookiesynchronisatie is van toepassing wanneer OpenClaw op een andere computer draait (externe modus)."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همگام‌سازی کوکی زمانی اعمال می‌شود که OpenClaw روی رایانه دیگری اجرا شود (حالت راه‌دور)."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Синхронизация cookie применяется, когда OpenClaw работает на другом компьютере (удалённый режим)."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookiesynkronisering gäller när OpenClaw körs på en annan dator (fjärrläge)."}}}},
    "Cookies are only synced for these domains; an empty list means nothing is synced.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookies are only synced for these domains; an empty list means nothing is synced."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"仅对这些域名同步 Cookie；空列表表示不同步任何内容。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"只有這些網域的 Cookie 會被同步；清單為空表示不會同步任何內容。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Os cookies são sincronizados apenas para esses domínios; uma lista vazia significa que nada é sincronizado."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookies werden nur für diese Domains synchronisiert; eine leere Liste bedeutet, dass nichts synchronisiert wird."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las cookies solo se sincronizan para estos dominios; una lista vacía significa que no se sincroniza nada."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookieはこれらのドメインについてのみ同期されます。リストが空の場合は何も同期されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"쿠키는 이 도메인에 대해서만 동기화됩니다. 목록이 비어 있으면 아무것도 동기화되지 않습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les cookies ne sont synchronisés que pour ces domaines ; une liste vide signifie qu'aucun cookie n'est synchronisé."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"कुकीज़ केवल इन डोमेन के लिए सिंक होती हैं; खाली सूची का मतलब है कि कुछ भी सिंक नहीं होता।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تتم مزامنة ملفات تعريف الارتباط لهذه النطاقات فقط؛ القائمة الفارغة تعني عدم مزامنة أي شيء."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"I cookie vengono sincronizzati solo per questi domini; un elenco vuoto significa che non viene sincronizzato nulla."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çerezler yalnızca bu alan adları için eşitlenir; boş bir liste hiçbir şeyin eşitlenmediği anlamına gelir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie синхронізуються лише для цих доменів; порожній список означає, що нічого не синхронізується."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie hanya disinkronkan untuk domain ini; daftar kosong berarti tidak ada yang disinkronkan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pliki cookie są synchronizowane tylko dla tych domen; pusta lista oznacza, że nic nie jest synchronizowane."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"คุกกี้จะถูกซิงค์สำหรับโดเมนเหล่านี้เท่านั้น หากรายการว่างเปล่าจะไม่มีการซิงค์ใด ๆ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie chỉ được đồng bộ cho các miền này; danh sách trống nghĩa là không đồng bộ gì cả."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookies worden alleen gesynchroniseerd voor deze domeinen; een lege lijst betekent dat er niets wordt gesynchroniseerd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"کوکی‌ها فقط برای این دامنه‌ها همگام‌سازی می‌شوند؛ فهرست خالی یعنی چیزی همگام‌سازی نمی‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookie синхронизируются только для этих доменов; пустой список означает, что ничего не синхронизируется."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cookies synkroniseras endast för dessa domäner; en tom lista innebär att ingenting synkroniseras."}}}},
