    "Everyday OpenClaw app behavior.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Everyday OpenClaw app behavior."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 应用的日常行为。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"日常 OpenClaw App 行為。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamento cotidiano do app OpenClaw."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alltägliches Verhalten der OpenClaw-App."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamiento cotidiano de la app OpenClaw."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw アプリの日常的な動作。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"일상적인 OpenClaw 앱 동작입니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportement quotidien de l’app OpenClaw."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"रोज़मर्रा का OpenClaw ऐप व्यवहार।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سلوك تطبيق OpenClaw اليومي."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comportamento quotidiano dell'app OpenClaw."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Günlük OpenClaw uygulama davranışı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Повсякденна поведінка застосунку OpenClaw."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Perilaku aplikasi OpenClaw sehari-hari."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codzienne działanie aplikacji OpenClaw."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ลักษณะการทำงานประจำวันของแอป OpenClaw"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hành vi hằng ngày của ứng dụng OpenClaw."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dagelijks gedrag van de OpenClaw-app."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"رفتار روزمره برنامه OpenClaw."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поведение приложения OpenClaw в повседневном использовании."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vardagligt beteende för OpenClaw-appen."}}}},
    "Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Everything runs where you decide, with permissions you grant."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切都在你决定的位置运行，并使用你授予的权限。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一切都在你決定的地方執行，並使用你授予的權限。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo roda onde você decidir, com as permissões que você conceder."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles läuft dort, wo Sie es festlegen, mit den Berechtigungen, die Sie erteilen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Todo se ejecuta donde tú decidas, con los permisos que concedas."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべてはあなたが決めた場所で、あなたが許可した権限で実行されます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모든 것은 사용자가 결정한 위치에서, 사용자가 부여한 권한으로 실행됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout s’exécute là où vous le décidez, avec les autorisations que vous accordez."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सब कुछ वहीं चलता है जहाँ आप तय करते हैं, आपकी दी गई अनुमतियों के साथ।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"كل شيء يعمل حيثما تقرر، وبالأذونات التي تمنحها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tutto viene eseguito dove decidi tu, con le autorizzazioni che concedi."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her şey, sizin verdiğiniz izinlerle, karar verdiğiniz yerde çalışır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе працює там, де ви вирішите, з дозволами, які ви надасте."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Semuanya berjalan di tempat yang Anda tentukan, dengan izin yang Anda berikan."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko działa tam, gdzie zdecydujesz, z uprawnieniami, których udzielisz."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ทุกอย่างทำงานในที่ที่คุณตัดสินใจ พร้อมสิทธิ์ที่คุณอนุญาต"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mọi thứ chạy ở nơi bạn quyết định, với các quyền bạn cấp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles draait waar jij beslist, met de machtigingen die jij verleent."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همه‌چیز هرجا که شما تصمیم بگیرید اجرا می‌شود، با مجوزهایی که شما اعطا می‌کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё работает там, где вы решите, с разрешениями, которые вы предоставите."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt körs där du bestämmer, med de behörigheter du ger."}}}},
    "Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exact HTTPS hosts, separated by commas or spaces. Empty allows config SecretRefs only."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"精确的 HTTPS 主机，用逗号或空格分隔。留空则仅允许配置 SecretRefs。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完整的 HTTPS 主機，以逗號或空格分隔。留空僅允許 config SecretRefs。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exatos, separados por vírgulas ou espaços. Vazio permite apenas SecretRefs de configuração."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakte HTTPS-Hosts, getrennt durch Kommas oder Leerzeichen. Leer erlaubt nur Konfigurations-SecretRefs."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hosts HTTPS exactos, separados por comas o espacios. Vacío permite solo SecretRefs de configuración."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正確なHTTPSホスト、カンマまたはスペースで区切ります。空の場合は設定のSecretRefsのみ許可します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"정확한 HTTPS 호스트, 쉼표 또는 공백으로 구분합니다. 비워 두면 config SecretRefs만 허용됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hôtes HTTPS exacts, séparés par des virgules ou des espaces. Vide autorise uniquement les SecretRefs de config."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सटीक HTTPS होस्ट, कॉमा या स्पेस से अलग किए गए। खाली रहने पर केवल config SecretRefs की अनुमति है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مضيفات HTTPS دقيقة، مفصولة بفواصل أو مسافات. الحقل الفارغ يسمح بإعدادات SecretRefs فقط."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS esatti, separati da virgole o spazi. Vuoto consente solo i SecretRef di configurazione."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tam HTTPS ana bilgisayarları, virgül veya boşlukla ayrılmış. Boş bırakmak yalnızca config SecretRef'lerine izin verir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точні HTTPS-хости, розділені комами або пробілами. Порожнє поле дозволяє лише SecretRefs у конфігурації."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Host HTTPS persis, dipisahkan dengan koma atau spasi. Kosong hanya mengizinkan SecretRefs config."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dokładne hosty HTTPS, oddzielone przecinkami lub spacjami. Puste zezwala tylko na SecretRefs konfiguracji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"โฮสต์ HTTPS แบบตรงตัว คั่นด้วยเครื่องหมายจุลภาคหรือช่องว่าง เว้นว่างไว้จะอนุญาตเฉพาะ SecretRefs ของ config เท่านั้น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các host HTTPS chính xác, phân tách bằng dấu phẩy hoặc dấu cách. Để trống chỉ cho phép config SecretRefs."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exacte HTTPS-hosts, gescheiden door komma's of spaties. Leeg staat alleen config-SecretRefs toe."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"میزبان‌های HTTPS دقیق، جداشده با کاما یا فاصله. خالی فقط SecretRefs پیکربندی را مجاز می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Точные HTTPS-хосты, разделённые запятыми или пробелами. Пустое значение разрешает только config SecretRefs."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exakta HTTPS-värdar, separerade med komma eller mellanslag. Tomt tillåter endast config SecretRefs."}}}},
    "Exec Approvals": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Approvals"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"执行审批"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行核准"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações de execução"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausführungsgenehmigungen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobaciones de ejecución"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbations d’exécution"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec अनुमोदन"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni esecuzione"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Onayları"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення виконання"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan Exec"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzanie wykonywania"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติ Exec"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phê duyệt thực thi"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uitvoeringsgoedkeuringen"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подтверждения выполнения"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Körningsgodkännanden"}}}},
    "Exec Approvals Unavailable": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Approvals Unavailable"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"无法使用执行批准"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無法使用執行核准"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprovações de Exec indisponíveis"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ausführungsgenehmigungen nicht verfügbar"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aprobaciones de ejecución no disponibles"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認は利用できません"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인을 사용할 수 없음"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approbations d'exécution indisponibles"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec अनुमोदन अनुपलब्ध"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ غير متاحة"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni Exec non disponibili"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec Onayları Kullanılamıyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення виконання недоступні"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan Exec Tidak Tersedia"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzenia Exec niedostępne"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติ Exec ไม่พร้อมใช้งาน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không thể phê duyệt Exec"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec-goedkeuringen niet beschikbaar"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا در دسترس نیست"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Одобрения выполнения недоступны"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec-godkännanden är inte tillgängliga"}}}},
    "Exec approvals unavailable. Retry to refresh.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec approvals unavailable. Retry to refresh."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"执行审批不可用。请重试以刷新。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"執行核准目前無法使用。請重試以重新整理。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"As aprovações de execução estão indisponíveis. Tente novamente para atualizar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec-Genehmigungen sind nicht verfügbar. Versuchen Sie es erneut, um sie zu aktualisieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Las aprobaciones de ejecución no están disponibles. Vuelve a intentarlo para actualizar."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"実行の承認を利用できません。再試行して更新してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"실행 승인을 사용할 수 없습니다. 새로 고치려면 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Les approbations d’exécution sont indisponibles. Réessayez pour actualiser."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec अनुमोदन उपलब्ध नहीं हैं। रीफ़्रेश करने के लिए फिर से प्रयास करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"موافقات التنفيذ غير متاحة. أعد المحاولة للتحديث."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Approvazioni di esecuzione non disponibili. Riprova per aggiornare."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Çalıştırma onayları kullanılamıyor. Yenilemek için tekrar deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Схвалення виконання недоступні. Повторіть спробу, щоб оновити."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Persetujuan exec tidak tersedia. Coba lagi untuk memuat ulang."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zatwierdzenia wykonywania są niedostępne. Ponów próbę, aby odświeżyć."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การอนุมัติ Exec ไม่พร้อมใช้งาน โปรดลองอีกครั้งเพื่อรีเฟรช"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Các phê duyệt thực thi không khả dụng. Thử lại để làm mới."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uitvoeringsgoedkeuringen zijn niet beschikbaar. Probeer opnieuw om te vernieuwen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تأییدهای اجرا در دسترس نیستند. برای تازه‌سازی دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Подтверждения выполнения недоступны. Повторите попытку, чтобы обновить."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exec-godkännanden är inte tillgängliga. Försök igen för att uppdatera."}}}},
