    "OpenClaw active": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw active"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 活动中"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 使用中"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ativo"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw aktiv"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw activo"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw がアクティブです"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 활성화됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw actif"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw सक्रिय है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نشط"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw attivo"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw etkin"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw активний"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw aktif"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw aktywny"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ทำงานอยู่"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang hoạt động"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw actief"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw فعال است"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw активен"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw aktiv"}}}},
    "OpenClaw can take actions using the permissions and services you enable. Review prompts and only connect tools you trust.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw can take actions using the permissions and services you enable. Review prompts and only connect tools you trust."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 可以使用你启用的权限和服务执行操作。请审核提示，并且只连接你信任的工具。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 可以使用你啟用的權限和服務來執行動作。請審查提示，並只連接你信任的工具。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw pode realizar ações usando as permissões e serviços que você habilitar. Revise os prompts e conecte apenas ferramentas em que você confia."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kann mit den von Ihnen aktivierten Berechtigungen und Diensten Aktionen ausführen. Prüfen Sie Aufforderungen und verbinden Sie nur Tools, denen Sie vertrauen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw puede realizar acciones con los permisos y servicios que habilites. Revisa los avisos y conecta solo herramientas en las que confíes."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は、有効にした権限とサービスを使用して操作を実行できます。プロンプトを確認し、信頼できるツールのみ接続してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw는 사용자가 활성화한 권한과 서비스를 사용해 작업을 수행할 수 있습니다. 프롬프트를 검토하고 신뢰하는 도구만 연결하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw peut effectuer des actions avec les autorisations et services que vous activez. Vérifiez les invites et ne connectez que les outils auxquels vous faites confiance."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw आपके सक्षम की गई अनुमतियों और सेवाओं का उपयोग करके कार्रवाइयाँ कर सकता है। प्रॉम्प्ट की समीक्षा करें और केवल उन टूल्स को कनेक्ट करें जिन पर आप भरोसा करते हैं।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يمكن لـ OpenClaw تنفيذ إجراءات باستخدام الأذونات والخدمات التي تفعّلها. راجع المطالبات ولا تربط إلا الأدوات التي تثق بها."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw può eseguire azioni usando le autorizzazioni e i servizi che abiliti. Rivedi i prompt e connetti solo strumenti di cui ti fidi."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, etkinleştirdiğiniz izinleri ve hizmetleri kullanarak eylemler gerçekleştirebilir. İstemleri gözden geçirin ve yalnızca güvendiğiniz araçları bağlayın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw може виконувати дії, використовуючи дозволи та сервіси, які ви ввімкнете. Переглядайте запити й підключайте лише інструменти, яким довіряєте."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw dapat melakukan tindakan menggunakan izin dan layanan yang Anda aktifkan. Tinjau permintaan dan hanya hubungkan alat yang Anda percayai."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw może wykonywać działania z użyciem włączonych przez Ciebie uprawnień i usług. Przeglądaj monity i łącz tylko narzędzia, którym ufasz."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw สามารถดำเนินการโดยใช้สิทธิ์และบริการที่คุณเปิดใช้งาน ตรวจสอบพรอมป์และเชื่อมต่อเฉพาะเครื่องมือที่คุณไว้วางใจ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw có thể thực hiện hành động bằng các quyền và dịch vụ bạn bật. Hãy xem lại lời nhắc và chỉ kết nối các công cụ bạn tin tưởng."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kan acties uitvoeren met de machtigingen en diensten die je inschakelt. Controleer prompts en verbind alleen tools die je vertrouwt."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw می‌تواند با استفاده از مجوزها و سرویس‌هایی که فعال می‌کنید اقداماتی انجام دهد. اعلان‌ها را بررسی کنید و فقط ابزارهایی را متصل کنید که به آن‌ها اعتماد دارید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw может выполнять действия с использованием разрешений и сервисов, которые вы включите. Проверяйте запросы и подключайте только те инструменты, которым доверяете."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kan utföra åtgärder med de behörigheter och tjänster du aktiverar. Granska uppmaningar och anslut bara verktyg du litar på."}}}},
    "OpenClaw connecting": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw connecting"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在连接"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 連線中"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw conectando"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wird verbunden"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw conectando"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw に接続中"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 연결 중"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connexion d'OpenClaw"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw कनेक्ट हो रहा है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw قيد الاتصال"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw in connessione"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bağlanıyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw підключається"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw menghubungkan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Łączenie OpenClaw"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw กำลังเชื่อมต่อ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang kết nối"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw verbindt"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"در حال اتصال OpenClaw"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw подключается"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ansluter"}}}},
    "OpenClaw connects to an independently managed Gateway on this Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw connects to an independently managed Gateway on this Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 连接到此 Mac 上独立管理的 Gateway。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 連接到此 Mac 上獨立管理的 Gateway。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw se conecta a um Gateway gerenciado de forma independente neste Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw verbindet sich mit einem unabhängig verwalteten Gateway auf diesem Mac."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se conecta a un Gateway gestionado de forma independiente en este Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw はこの Mac 上で独立して管理される Gateway に接続します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 이 Mac의 독립적으로 관리되는 Gateway에 연결됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se connecte à un Gateway géré indépendamment sur ce Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw इस Mac पर स्वतंत्र रूप से प्रबंधित Gateway से कनेक्ट होता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يتصل OpenClaw بـ Gateway مُدار بشكل مستقل على جهاز Mac هذا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw si connette a un Gateway gestito in modo indipendente su questo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bu Mac'te bağımsız yönetilen bir Gateway'e bağlanır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw підключається до незалежно керованого Gateway на цьому Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw terhubung ke Gateway yang dikelola secara independen di Mac ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw łączy się z niezależnie zarządzanym Gateway na tym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw เชื่อมต่อกับ Gateway ที่จัดการอย่างอิสระบน Mac เครื่องนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kết nối tới một Gateway được quản lý độc lập trên máy Mac này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw maakt verbinding met een onafhankelijk beheerde Gateway op deze Mac."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw به یک Gateway مدیریت‌شده مستقل روی این مک متصل می‌شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw подключается к независимо управляемому Gateway на этом Mac."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ansluter till en oberoende hanterad Gateway på den här Mac-datorn."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not confirm the agent notification. It will not retry, to avoid a duplicate welcome.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not confirm the agent notification. It will not retry, to avoid a duplicate welcome."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法确认智能体通知。为避免重复发送欢迎消息，将不会重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法確認代理程式通知。為避免重複顯示歡迎訊息，將不會重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu confirmar a notificação do agente. Não haverá uma nova tentativa para evitar uma mensagem de boas-vindas duplicada."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte die Agentenbenachrichtigung nicht bestätigen. Es wird keinen weiteren Versuch unternehmen, um eine doppelte Begrüßung zu vermeiden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo confirmar la notificación al agente. No volverá a intentarlo para evitar una bienvenida duplicada."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawはエージェントへの通知を確認できませんでした。ウェルカムメッセージの重複を避けるため、再試行は行いません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw에서 에이전트 알림을 확인하지 못했습니다. 환영 메시지가 중복되지 않도록 다시 시도하지 않습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu confirmer la notification de l’agent. Il ne réessaiera pas afin d’éviter un message de bienvenue en double."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw एजेंट की सूचना की पुष्टि नहीं कर सका। डुप्लिकेट स्वागत संदेश से बचने के लिए यह दोबारा प्रयास नहीं करेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر على OpenClaw تأكيد إشعار الوكيل. لن يعيد المحاولة لتجنب تكرار رسالة الترحيب."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non ha potuto confermare la notifica dell'agente. Non riproverà, per evitare un messaggio di benvenuto duplicato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, temsilci bildirimini doğrulayamadı. Yinelenen bir karşılama mesajını önlemek için yeniden denemeyecek."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося підтвердити сповіщення агента. Повторної спроби не буде, щоб уникнути дублювання привітання."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat mengonfirmasi notifikasi agen. OpenClaw tidak akan mencoba lagi untuk menghindari sambutan duplikat."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł potwierdzić powiadomienia agenta. Nie ponowi próby, aby uniknąć powielenia wiadomości powitalnej."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถยืนยันการแจ้งเตือนเอเจนต์ได้ และจะไม่ลองอีกครั้งเพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงข้อความต้อนรับซ้ำ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể xác nhận thông báo cho tác nhân. OpenClaw sẽ không thử lại để tránh gửi lời chào mừng trùng lặp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon de agentmelding niet bevestigen. Er wordt geen nieuwe poging gedaan om een dubbele welkomstmelding te voorkomen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست اعلان عامل را تأیید کند. برای جلوگیری از ارسال پیام خوش‌آمدگویی تکراری، دوباره تلاش نخواهد کرد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось подтвердить уведомление агента. Повторной попытки не будет, чтобы избежать дублирующего приветствия."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte bekräfta agentaviseringen. Ett nytt försök görs inte för att undvika ett dubblerat välkomstmeddelande."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not load editable settings for this channel.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not load editable settings for this channel."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法加载此频道的可编辑设置。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法載入此頻道的可編輯設定。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu carregar as configurações editáveis deste canal."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte die bearbeitbaren Einstellungen für diesen Kanal nicht laden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo cargar los ajustes editables para este canal."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw はこのチャンネルの編集可能な設定を読み込めませんでした。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw에서 이 채널의 편집 가능한 설정을 로드할 수 없습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu charger les paramètres modifiables de ce canal."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw इस चैनल के लिए संपादन योग्य सेटिंग्स लोड नहीं कर सका।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر على OpenClaw تحميل الإعدادات القابلة للتعديل لهذه القناة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non ha potuto caricare le impostazioni modificabili per questo canale."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bu kanal için düzenlenebilir ayarları yükleyemedi."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося завантажити редаговані налаштування для цього каналу."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat memuat pengaturan yang dapat diedit untuk channel ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł wczytać edytowalnych ustawień dla tego kanału."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถโหลดการตั้งค่าที่แก้ไขได้สำหรับช่องทางนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể tải cài đặt có thể chỉnh sửa cho kênh này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon de bewerkbare instellingen voor dit kanaal niet laden."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست تنظیمات قابل ویرایش این کانال را بارگذاری کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось загрузить редактируемые настройки для этого канала."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte läsa in redigerbara inställningar för den här kanalen."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not notify your agent automatically. The app and Gateway update are complete.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not notify your agent automatically. The app and Gateway update are complete."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法自动通知您的代理。应用和 Gateway 更新已完成。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法自動通知您的代理程式。應用程式與 Gateway 已完成更新。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu notificar seu agente automaticamente. A atualização do aplicativo e do Gateway foi concluída."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte Ihren Agenten nicht automatisch benachrichtigen. Die Aktualisierung der App und des Gateway ist abgeschlossen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo notificar automáticamente a tu agente. La actualización de la aplicación y del Gateway se ha completado."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawはエージェントに自動で通知できませんでした。アプリとGatewayのアップデートは完了しています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 에이전트에게 자동으로 알리지 못했습니다. 앱 및 Gateway 업데이트가 완료되었습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu notifier automatiquement votre agent. La mise à jour de l’app et du Gateway est terminée."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw आपके एजेंट को स्वचालित रूप से सूचित नहीं कर सका। ऐप और Gateway का अपडेट पूरा हो गया है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر على OpenClaw إشعار وكيلك تلقائيًا. اكتمل تحديث التطبيق وGateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non ha potuto inviare automaticamente una notifica al tuo agente. L’aggiornamento dell’app e del Gateway è stato completato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, aracınıza otomatik olarak bildirim gönderemedi. Uygulama ve Gateway güncellemesi tamamlandı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося автоматично сповістити вашого агента. Оновлення застосунку та Gateway завершено."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat memberi tahu agen Anda secara otomatis. Pembaruan aplikasi dan Gateway telah selesai."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł automatycznie powiadomić agenta. Aktualizacja aplikacji i Gateway została ukończona."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถแจ้งเอเจนต์ของคุณโดยอัตโนมัติได้ การอัปเดตแอปและ Gateway เสร็จสมบูรณ์แล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể tự động thông báo cho tác nhân của bạn. Quá trình cập nhật ứng dụng và Gateway đã hoàn tất."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon je agent niet automatisch informeren. De updates van de app en Gateway zijn voltooid."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست به‌طور خودکار به عامل شما اطلاع دهد. به‌روزرسانی برنامه و Gateway کامل شده است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось автоматически уведомить вашего агента. Обновление приложения и Gateway завершено."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte meddela din agent automatiskt. Uppdateringen av appen och Gateway är klar."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not notify your agent automatically. The app and Mac node update are complete.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not notify your agent automatically. The app and Mac node update are complete."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法自动通知您的代理。应用和 Mac 节点更新已完成。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法自動通知您的代理程式。應用程式與 Mac 節點已完成更新。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu notificar seu agente automaticamente. A atualização do aplicativo e do nó do Mac foi concluída."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte Ihren Agenten nicht automatisch benachrichtigen. Die Aktualisierung der App und des Mac-Knotens ist abgeschlossen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo notificar automáticamente a tu agente. La actualización de la aplicación y del nodo de Mac se ha completado."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawはエージェントに自動で通知できませんでした。アプリとMacノードのアップデートは完了しています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 에이전트에게 자동으로 알리지 못했습니다. 앱 및 Mac 노드 업데이트가 완료되었습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu notifier automatiquement votre agent. La mise à jour de l’app et du nœud Mac est terminée."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw आपके एजेंट को स्वचालित रूप से सूचित नहीं कर सका। ऐप और Mac नोड का अपडेट पूरा हो गया है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر على OpenClaw إشعار وكيلك تلقائيًا. اكتمل تحديث التطبيق وعقدة Mac."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non ha potuto inviare automaticamente una notifica al tuo agente. L’aggiornamento dell’app e del nodo Mac è stato completato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, aracınıza otomatik olarak bildirim gönderemedi. Uygulama ve Mac düğümü güncellemesi tamamlandı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося автоматично сповістити вашого агента. Оновлення застосунку та вузла Mac завершено."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat memberi tahu agen Anda secara otomatis. Pembaruan aplikasi dan node Mac telah selesai."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł automatycznie powiadomić agenta. Aktualizacja aplikacji i węzła Mac została ukończona."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถแจ้งเอเจนต์ของคุณโดยอัตโนมัติได้ การอัปเดตแอปและโหนด Mac เสร็จสมบูรณ์แล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể tự động thông báo cho tác nhân của bạn. Quá trình cập nhật ứng dụng và nút Mac đã hoàn tất."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon je agent niet automatisch informeren. De updates van de app en het Mac-knooppunt zijn voltooid."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست به‌طور خودکار به عامل شما اطلاع دهد. به‌روزرسانی برنامه و گره Mac کامل شده است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось автоматически уведомить вашего агента. Обновление приложения и узла Mac завершено."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte meddela din agent automatiskt. Uppdateringen av appen och Mac-noden är klar."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not read the Gateway service ownership record. Retry after checking the Gateway LaunchAgent.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not read the Gateway service ownership record. Retry after checking the Gateway LaunchAgent."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法读取 Gateway 服务所有权记录。请检查 Gateway LaunchAgent 后重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法讀取 Gateway 服務的擁有權記錄。請檢查 Gateway LaunchAgent 後重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu ler o registro de propriedade do serviço Gateway. Tente novamente após verificar o LaunchAgent do Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte den Eigentümerschaftseintrag des Gateway-Dienstes nicht lesen. Versuchen Sie es erneut, nachdem Sie den Gateway LaunchAgent überprüft haben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo leer el registro de propiedad del servicio Gateway. Vuelve a intentarlo después de comprobar el LaunchAgent de Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawはGatewayサービスの所有権レコードを読み取れませんでした。GatewayのLaunchAgentを確認してから再試行してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw에서 Gateway 서비스 소유권 기록을 읽을 수 없습니다. Gateway LaunchAgent를 확인한 후 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu lire l’enregistrement de propriété du service Gateway. Réessayez après avoir vérifié le LaunchAgent du Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, Gateway सेवा के स्वामित्व का रिकॉर्ड नहीं पढ़ सका। Gateway LaunchAgent की जाँच करने के बाद फिर से प्रयास करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر على OpenClaw قراءة سجل ملكية خدمة Gateway. أعد المحاولة بعد التحقق من Gateway LaunchAgent."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non è riuscito a leggere il record di proprietà del servizio Gateway. Riprova dopo aver verificato il LaunchAgent del Gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, Gateway hizmetinin sahiplik kaydını okuyamadı. Gateway LaunchAgent'ı kontrol ettikten sonra yeniden deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося прочитати запис про власника служби Gateway. Повторіть спробу після перевірки Gateway LaunchAgent."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat membaca catatan kepemilikan layanan Gateway. Coba lagi setelah memeriksa LaunchAgent Gateway."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł odczytać informacji o właścicielu usługi Gateway. Spróbuj ponownie po sprawdzeniu LaunchAgent usługi Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถอ่านบันทึกความเป็นเจ้าของบริการ Gateway ได้ โปรดลองอีกครั้งหลังจากตรวจสอบ Gateway LaunchAgent"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể đọc bản ghi quyền sở hữu dịch vụ Gateway. Hãy thử lại sau khi kiểm tra LaunchAgent của Gateway."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon de eigendomsregistratie van de Gateway-service niet lezen. Probeer het opnieuw nadat je de Gateway LaunchAgent hebt gecontroleerd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست سابقه مالکیت سرویس Gateway را بخواند. پس از بررسی LaunchAgent مربوط به Gateway دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось прочитать запись о владельце службы Gateway. Повторите попытку после проверки LaunchAgent для Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte läsa ägarposten för Gateway-tjänsten. Försök igen efter att ha kontrollerat Gateway LaunchAgent."}}}},
    "OpenClaw could not read the node service ownership record. Retry after checking the node LaunchAgent.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw could not read the node service ownership record. Retry after checking the node LaunchAgent."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法读取节点服务所有权记录。请检查节点 LaunchAgent 后重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法讀取節點服務的擁有權記錄。請檢查節點 LaunchAgent 後重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw não conseguiu ler o registro de propriedade do serviço do nó. Tente novamente após verificar o LaunchAgent do nó."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte den Eigentümerschaftseintrag des Knotendienstes nicht lesen. Versuchen Sie es erneut, nachdem Sie den Knoten-LaunchAgent überprüft haben."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw no pudo leer el registro de propiedad del servicio del nodo. Vuelve a intentarlo después de comprobar el LaunchAgent del nodo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawはノードサービスの所有権レコードを読み取れませんでした。ノードのLaunchAgentを確認してから再試行してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw에서 노드 서비스 소유권 기록을 읽을 수 없습니다. 노드 LaunchAgent를 확인한 후 다시 시도하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu lire l’enregistrement de propriété du service de nœud. Réessayez après avoir vérifié le LaunchAgent du nœud."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, नोड सेवा के स्वामित्व का रिकॉर्ड नहीं पढ़ सका। नोड LaunchAgent की जाँच करने के बाद फिर से प्रयास करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر على OpenClaw قراءة سجل ملكية خدمة العقدة. أعد المحاولة بعد التحقق من node LaunchAgent."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw non è riuscito a leggere il record di proprietà del servizio del nodo. Riprova dopo aver verificato il LaunchAgent del nodo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, düğüm hizmetinin sahiplik kaydını okuyamadı. Düğüm LaunchAgent'ını kontrol ettikten sonra yeniden deneyin."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося прочитати запис про власника служби вузла. Повторіть спробу після перевірки LaunchAgent вузла."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat membaca catatan kepemilikan layanan node. Coba lagi setelah memeriksa LaunchAgent node."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw nie mógł odczytać informacji o właścicielu usługi węzła. Spróbuj ponownie po sprawdzeniu LaunchAgent węzła."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ไม่สามารถอ่านบันทึกความเป็นเจ้าของบริการโหนดได้ โปรดลองอีกครั้งหลังจากตรวจสอบ node LaunchAgent"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw không thể đọc bản ghi quyền sở hữu dịch vụ nút. Hãy thử lại sau khi kiểm tra LaunchAgent của nút."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon de eigendomsregistratie van de node-service niet lezen. Probeer het opnieuw nadat je de node LaunchAgent hebt gecontroleerd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست سابقه مالکیت سرویس گره را بخواند. پس از بررسی LaunchAgent مربوط به گره دوباره تلاش کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не удалось прочитать запись о владельце службы узла. Повторите попытку после проверки LaunchAgent для узла."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte läsa ägarposten för nodtjänsten. Försök igen efter att ha kontrollerat nodens LaunchAgent."}}}},
    "OpenClaw couldn’t be installed in Applications. Move it there manually, then open that copy.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw couldn’t be installed in Applications. Move it there manually, then open that copy."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 无法安装到“应用程序”中。请手动将其移至该位置，然后打开那份副本。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 無法安裝到「應用程式」中。請手動將其移至該處，然後開啟該副本。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Não foi possível instalar o OpenClaw em Aplicativos. Mova-o para lá manualmente e abra essa cópia."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw konnte nicht im Ordner „Programme“ installiert werden. Verschiebe es manuell dorthin und öffne dann diese Kopie."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo instalar OpenClaw en Aplicaciones. Muévelo allí manualmente y luego abre esa copia."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw を Applications にインストールできませんでした。手動で移動してから、そのコピーを開いてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw를 응용 프로그램에 설치할 수 없습니다. 수동으로 이동한 다음 해당 복사본을 여세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw n’a pas pu être installé dans Applications. Déplacez-le là manuellement, puis ouvrez cette copie."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw को Applications में इंस्टॉल नहीं किया जा सका। इसे मैन्युअल रूप से वहां ले जाएं, फिर उस कॉपी को खोलें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذّر تثبيت OpenClaw في التطبيقات. انقله إلى هناك يدويًا، ثم افتح تلك النسخة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossibile installare OpenClaw in Applicazioni. Spostalo lì manualmente, poi apri quella copia."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, Applications klasörüne yüklenemedi. Dosyayı manuel olarak oraya taşıyın, ardından o kopyayı açın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw не вдалося встановити в Applications. Перемістіть його туди вручну, потім відкрийте цю копію."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw tidak dapat diinstal di Applications. Pindahkan ke sana secara manual, lalu buka salinan tersebut."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nie udało się zainstalować OpenClaw w folderze Aplikacje. Przenieś go tam ręcznie, a następnie otwórz tę kopię."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ไม่สามารถติดตั้ง OpenClaw ใน Applications ได้ ย้ายไปที่นั่นด้วยตนเอง แล้วเปิดสำเนานั้น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không thể cài đặt OpenClaw trong Applications. Hãy chuyển nó vào đó thủ công, sau đó mở bản sao đó."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kon niet in Programma's worden geïnstalleerd. Verplaats het daar handmatig naartoe en open die kopie."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نتوانست در Applications نصب شود. آن را به‌صورت دستی به آنجا منتقل کنید، سپس آن نسخه را باز کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось установить OpenClaw в Applications. Переместите приложение туда вручную, затем откройте эту копию."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kunde inte installeras i Program. Flytta det dit manuellt och öppna sedan den kopian."}}}},
    "OpenClaw installation failed": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw installation failed"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 安装失败"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 安裝失敗"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A instalação do OpenClaw falhou"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-Installation fehlgeschlagen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"La instalación de OpenClaw falló"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw のインストールに失敗しました"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 설치 실패"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Échec de l'installation d'OpenClaw"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw इंस्टॉलेशन विफल रहा"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"فشل تثبيت OpenClaw"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installazione di OpenClaw non riuscita"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kurulumu başarısız oldu"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не вдалося встановити OpenClaw"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalasi OpenClaw gagal"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Instalacja OpenClaw nie powiodła się"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การติดตั้ง OpenClaw ล้มเหลว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cài đặt OpenClaw thất bại"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-installatie mislukt"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نصب OpenClaw ناموفق بود"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось установить OpenClaw"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Installationen av OpenClaw misslyckades"}}}},
    "OpenClaw installed the update but could not verify the Gateway connection.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw installed the update but could not verify the Gateway connection."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已安装更新，但无法验证 Gateway 连接。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已安裝更新，但無法驗證 Gateway 連線。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw instalou a atualização, mas não conseguiu verificar a conexão com o Gateway."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw hat das Update installiert, konnte die Gateway-Verbindung jedoch nicht überprüfen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw instaló la actualización, pero no pudo verificar la conexión con el Gateway."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw はアップデートをインストールしましたが、Gateway への接続を確認できませんでした。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw에서 업데이트를 설치했지만 Gateway 연결을 확인하지 못했습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw a installé la mise à jour, mais n’a pas pu vérifier la connexion au Gateway."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ने अपडेट इंस्टॉल कर दिया, लेकिन Gateway कनेक्शन सत्यापित नहीं कर सका।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ثبّت OpenClaw التحديث، لكنه تعذّر عليه التحقق من اتصال Gateway."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ha installato l'aggiornamento, ma non ha potuto verificare la connessione al Gateway."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw güncellemeyi yükledi ancak Gateway bağlantısını doğrulayamadı."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw установив оновлення, але не зміг перевірити підключення до Gateway."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw menginstal pembaruan tetapi tidak dapat memverifikasi koneksi Gateway."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw zainstalował aktualizację, ale nie mógł zweryfikować połączenia z Gateway."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ติดตั้งการอัปเดตแล้ว แต่ไม่สามารถตรวจสอบการเชื่อมต่อ Gateway ได้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đã cài đặt bản cập nhật nhưng không thể xác minh kết nối Gateway."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw heeft de update geïnstalleerd, maar kon de verbinding met de Gateway niet verifiëren."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw به‌روزرسانی را نصب کرد، اما نتوانست اتصال Gateway را تأیید کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw установил обновление, но не смог проверить подключение к Gateway."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw installerade uppdateringen men kunde inte verifiera anslutningen till Gateway."}}}},
    "OpenClaw is completing provider sign-in.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is completing provider sign-in."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在完成提供方登录。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在完成供應商登入。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw está concluindo o login do provedor."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw schließt die Anbieteranmeldung ab."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está completando el inicio de sesión del proveedor."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw はプロバイダーのサインインを完了しています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 공급자 로그인을 완료하고 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw termine la connexion au fournisseur."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw प्रोवाइडर साइन-इन पूरा कर रहा है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يكمل OpenClaw تسجيل الدخول إلى المزوّد."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sta completando l'accesso al provider."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sağlayıcı oturum açma işlemini tamamlıyor."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw завершує вхід до постачальника."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sedang menyelesaikan proses masuk penyedia."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kończy logowanie do dostawcy."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw กำลังดำเนินการลงชื่อเข้าใช้ผู้ให้บริการให้เสร็จสมบูรณ์"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang hoàn tất đăng nhập nhà cung cấp."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw voltooit de aanmelding bij de provider."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw در حال تکمیل ورود ارائه‌دهنده است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw завершает вход у провайдера."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw slutför inloggningen hos leverantören."}}}},
    "OpenClaw is installed in Applications, but couldn’t reopen automatically. Open it there manually.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is installed in Applications, but couldn’t reopen automatically. Open it there manually."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已安装到“应用程序”中，但无法自动重新打开。请在那里手动打开它。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已安裝到「應用程式」中，但無法自動重新開啟。請在該處手動開啟。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw está instalado em Aplicativos, mas não foi possível reabri-lo automaticamente. Abra-o lá manualmente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ist im Ordner „Programme“ installiert, konnte aber nicht automatisch erneut geöffnet werden. Öffne es dort manuell."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está instalado en Aplicaciones, pero no se pudo reabrir automáticamente. Ábrelo allí manualmente."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は Applications にインストールされましたが、自動的に再起動できませんでした。手動でそこから開いてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 응용 프로그램에 설치되었지만 자동으로 다시 열 수 없습니다. 그곳에서 수동으로 여세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw est installé dans Applications, mais n’a pas pu se rouvrir automatiquement. Ouvrez-le là manuellement."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw Applications में इंस्टॉल है, लेकिन स्वचालित रूप से फिर से नहीं खुल सका। इसे वहां मैन्युअल रूप से खोलें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تم تثبيت OpenClaw في التطبيقات، لكن تعذّرت إعادة فتحه تلقائيًا. افتحه هناك يدويًا."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw è installato in Applicazioni, ma non è stato possibile riaprirlo automaticamente. Aprilo lì manualmente."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, Applications klasörüne yüklendi ancak otomatik olarak yeniden açılamadı. Uygulamayı orada manuel olarak açın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw встановлено в Applications, але не вдалося повторно відкрити автоматично. Відкрийте його там вручну."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw terinstal di Applications, tetapi tidak dapat membuka kembali secara otomatis. Buka di sana secara manual."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw jest zainstalowany w folderze Aplikacje, ale nie udało się go otworzyć ponownie automatycznie. Otwórz go tam ręcznie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ถูกติดตั้งใน Applications แล้ว แต่ไม่สามารถเปิดใหม่โดยอัตโนมัติได้ เปิดที่นั่นด้วยตนเอง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đã được cài đặt trong Applications, nhưng không thể mở lại tự động. Hãy mở nó ở đó thủ công."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is geïnstalleerd in Programma's, maar kon niet automatisch opnieuw worden geopend. Open het daar handmatig."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw در Applications نصب شد، اما نتوانست به‌صورت خودکار دوباره باز شود. آن را به‌صورت دستی از آنجا باز کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw установлен в Applications, но не смог открыться автоматически. Откройте его там вручную."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw är installerat i Program, men kunde inte öppnas igen automatiskt. Öppna det där manuellt."}}}},
    "OpenClaw is paused": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is paused"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已暂停"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已暫停"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está pausado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ist pausiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está en pausa"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は一時停止中です"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw이 일시 중지됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw est en pause"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw रोका गया है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw متوقف مؤقتًا"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw è in pausa"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw duraklatıldı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw призупинено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw dijeda"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw jest wstrzymany"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw หยุดชั่วคราวอยู่"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang tạm dừng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is gepauzeerd"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw متوقف شده است"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw приостановлен"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw är pausat"}}}},
    "OpenClaw is preparing a local model.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is preparing a local model."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在准备本地模型。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在準備本機模型。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw está preparando um modelo local."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bereitet ein lokales Modell vor."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está preparando un modelo local."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw はローカルモデルを準備しています。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 로컬 모델을 준비하고 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw prépare un modèle local."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw एक लोकल मॉडल तैयार कर रहा है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يقوم OpenClaw بإعداد نموذج محلي."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sta preparando un modello locale."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw yerel bir model hazırlıyor."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw готує локальну модель."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sedang menyiapkan model lokal."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw przygotowuje model lokalny."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw กำลังเตรียมโมเดลในเครื่อง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang chuẩn bị một mô hình cục bộ."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bereidt een lokaal model voor."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw در حال آماده‌سازی یک مدل محلی است."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw подготавливает локальную модель."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw förbereder en lokal modell."}}}},
    "OpenClaw is working…": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is working…"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在工作…"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 正在處理…"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw está trabalhando…"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw arbeitet…"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw está trabajando…"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawが処理中です…"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 작업 중입니다…"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw est en cours d’exécution…"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw काम कर रहा है…"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw قيد العمل…"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw è in funzione…"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw çalışıyor…"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw працює…"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sedang bekerja…"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw działa…"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw กำลังทำงาน…"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đang hoạt động…"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is bezig…"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw در حال کار است…"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw работает…"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw arbetar…"}}}},
    "OpenClaw needs attention": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw needs attention"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 需要注意"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 需要注意"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw precisa de atenção"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw erfordert Aufmerksamkeit"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw necesita atención"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw に対応が必要です"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 주의 필요"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw requiert votre attention"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw को ध्यान देने की आवश्यकता है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw يحتاج إلى انتباه"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw richiede attenzione"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw dikkat gerektiriyor"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw потребує уваги"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw perlu perhatian"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wymaga uwagi"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ต้องการการดูแล"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw cần chú ý"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw vereist aandacht"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw نیاز به توجه دارد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw требует внимания"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw behöver åtgärd"}}}},
    "OpenClaw only asks for macOS capabilities when a feature needs them.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw only asks for macOS capabilities when a feature needs them."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 仅在功能需要时才会请求 macOS 能力。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 只會在功能需要時要求 macOS 能力。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw só solicita recursos do macOS quando um recurso precisa deles."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw fragt nur dann nach macOS-Funktionen, wenn eine Funktion sie benötigt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw solo solicita capacidades de macOS cuando una función las necesita."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawは、機能で必要な場合にのみmacOSの機能へのアクセスを求めます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw는 기능에 필요할 때만 macOS 기능 권한을 요청합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ne demande des fonctionnalités macOS que lorsqu’une fonctionnalité en a besoin."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw केवल तभी macOS क्षमताओं के लिए पूछता है, जब किसी सुविधा को उनकी आवश्यकता होती है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لا يطلب OpenClaw إمكانات macOS إلا عندما تحتاج إليها ميزة ما."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw richiede le funzionalità di macOS solo quando una funzione ne ha bisogno."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw yalnızca bir özellik ihtiyaç duyduğunda macOS yetenekleri ister."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw запитує можливості macOS лише тоді, коли вони потрібні функції."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw hanya meminta kemampuan macOS saat suatu fitur membutuhkannya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw prosi o funkcje macOS tylko wtedy, gdy wymaga ich dana funkcja."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw จะขอความสามารถของ macOS เฉพาะเมื่อฟีเจอร์จำเป็นต้องใช้เท่านั้น"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw chỉ yêu cầu các khả năng của macOS khi một tính năng cần đến chúng."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw vraagt alleen om macOS-mogelijkheden wanneer een functie ze nodig heeft."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw فقط زمانی قابلیت‌های macOS را درخواست می‌کند که یک ویژگی به آن‌ها نیاز داشته باشد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw запрашивает возможности macOS только тогда, когда они нужны функции."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ber bara om macOS-funktioner när en funktion behöver dem."}}}},
    "OpenClaw paused": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw paused"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已暂停"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已暫停"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw pausado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw pausiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw en pausa"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は一時停止中"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 일시 중지됨"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw en pause"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw रुका हुआ है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw متوقف مؤقتًا"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw in pausa"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw duraklatıldı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw призупинено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw dijeda"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wstrzymany"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw หยุดชั่วคราว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đã tạm dừng"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw gepauzeerd"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw متوقف شده است"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw приостановлен"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw pausad"}}}},
    "OpenClaw project root": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw project root"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 项目根目录"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 專案根目錄"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Raiz do projeto OpenClaw"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-Projektstammverzeichnis"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Raíz del proyecto OpenClaw"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw プロジェクトルート"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 프로젝트 루트"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Racine du projet OpenClaw"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw प्रोजेक्ट रूट"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"جذر مشروع OpenClaw"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Root del progetto OpenClaw"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw proje kökü"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Корінь проєкту OpenClaw"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Root proyek OpenClaw"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Katalog główny projektu OpenClaw"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"รูทโปรเจกต์ OpenClaw"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thư mục gốc dự án OpenClaw"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-projectroot"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ریشه پروژه OpenClaw"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Корень проекта OpenClaw"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw-projektrot"}}}},
    "OpenClaw reacts when any trigger appears in a transcription. Keep phrases short to avoid false positives.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reacts when any trigger appears in a transcription. Keep phrases short to avoid false positives."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当转录中出现任何触发词时，OpenClaw 会做出响应。请保持短语简短，以避免误触发。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當轉錄中出現任何觸發詞時，OpenClaw 會做出反應。請保持短語簡短，以避免誤觸發。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reage quando qualquer acionador aparece em uma transcrição. Mantenha as frases curtas para evitar falsos positivos."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reagiert, wenn ein Auslöser in einer Transkription erscheint. Halten Sie Phrasen kurz, um Fehlalarme zu vermeiden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reacciona cuando aparece cualquier activador en una transcripción. Mantén las frases cortas para evitar falsos positivos."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は、文字起こしにいずれかのトリガーが現れると反応します。誤検出を避けるため、フレーズは短くしてください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw는 전사에 트리거가 나타나면 반응합니다. 오탐을 피하려면 문구를 짧게 유지하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw réagit lorsqu’un déclencheur apparaît dans une transcription. Gardez les phrases courtes pour éviter les faux positifs."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw किसी भी ट्रिगर के ट्रांसक्रिप्शन में दिखाई देने पर प्रतिक्रिया देता है। गलत सक्रियण से बचने के लिए वाक्यांश छोटे रखें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يتفاعل OpenClaw عند ظهور أي كلمة تشغيل في النسخ. اجعل العبارات قصيرة لتجنب النتائج الإيجابية الخاطئة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reagisce quando un'attivazione compare in una trascrizione. Mantieni le frasi brevi per evitare falsi positivi."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, bir transkripsiyonda herhangi bir tetikleyici göründüğünde tepki verir. Yanlış pozitifleri önlemek için ifadeleri kısa tutun."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw реагує, коли будь-який тригер з’являється в транскрипції. Використовуйте короткі фрази, щоб уникнути хибних спрацьовувань."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bereaksi saat pemicu apa pun muncul dalam transkripsi. Buat frasa tetap singkat untuk menghindari positif palsu."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reaguje, gdy w transkrypcji pojawi się dowolny wyzwalacz. Używaj krótkich fraz, aby uniknąć fałszywych wykryć."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw จะตอบสนองเมื่อมีทริกเกอร์ใด ๆ ปรากฏในการถอดเสียง ควรใช้วลีสั้น ๆ เพื่อหลีกเลี่ยงการตรวจจับผิดพลาด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw phản hồi khi bất kỳ từ kích hoạt nào xuất hiện trong bản chép lời. Giữ cụm từ ngắn để tránh nhận nhầm."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reageert wanneer er een trigger in een transcriptie verschijnt. Houd zinnen kort om fout-positieven te voorkomen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw زمانی واکنش نشان می‌دهد که هر فعال‌سازی در رونوشت ظاهر شود. برای جلوگیری از تشخیص‌های نادرست، عبارت‌ها را کوتاه نگه دارید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw реагирует, когда в расшифровке появляется любой триггер. Используйте короткие фразы, чтобы избежать ложных срабатываний."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw reagerar när en aktivering förekommer i en transkribering. Håll fraserna korta för att undvika falska positiva träffar."}}}},
    "OpenClaw runs": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw runs"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 运行位置"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 執行於"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw é executado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wird ausgeführt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se ejecuta"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw の実行場所"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 실행 위치"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw s’exécute"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw चलता है"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يعمل OpenClaw"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw viene eseguito"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw çalışır"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw працює"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw berjalan"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw działa"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ทำงาน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw chạy"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw draait"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw اجرا می‌شود"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw работает"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw körs"}}}},
    "OpenClaw starts and monitors the Gateway on this Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw starts and monitors the Gateway on this Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 会在此 Mac 上启动并监控 Gateway。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 會在此 Mac 上啟動並監控 Gateway。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw inicia e monitora o Gateway neste Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw startet und überwacht die Gateway auf diesem Mac."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw inicia y supervisa el Gateway en este Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw がこの Mac 上で Gateway を起動し、監視します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 이 Mac에서 Gateway를 시작하고 모니터링합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw démarre et surveille le Gateway sur ce Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw इस Mac पर Gateway शुरू करता है और उसकी निगरानी करता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يقوم OpenClaw بتشغيل Gateway ومراقبته على هذا الـ Mac."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw avvia e monitora il Gateway su questo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, Gateway’i bu Mac’te başlatır ve izler."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw запускає та відстежує Gateway на цьому Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw memulai dan memantau Gateway di Mac ini."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw uruchamia i monitoruje Gateway na tym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw เริ่มและตรวจสอบ Gateway บน Mac เครื่องนี้"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw khởi động và giám sát Gateway trên máy Mac này."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw start en bewaakt de Gateway op deze Mac."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw، Gateway را روی این Mac راه‌اندازی و پایش می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw запускает и отслеживает Gateway на этом Mac."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw startar och övervakar Gateway på den här Mac-datorn."}}}},
    "OpenClaw updated": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw updated"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已更新"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已更新"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw atualizado"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wurde aktualisiert"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se actualizó"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawがアップデートされました"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 업데이트 완료"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw a été mis à jour"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw अपडेट हो गया"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تم تحديث OpenClaw"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw aggiornato"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw güncellendi"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw оновлено"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw diperbarui"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zaktualizowano OpenClaw"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"อัปเดต OpenClaw แล้ว"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã cập nhật OpenClaw"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw bijgewerkt"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw به‌روزرسانی شد"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw обновлён"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw har uppdaterats"}}}},
    "OpenClaw was interrupted. Restart to try again.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw was interrupted. Restart to try again."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已中断。请重新启动后再试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 已中斷。請重新啟動再試一次。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw foi interrompido. Reinicie para tentar novamente."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wurde unterbrochen. Starten Sie es neu, um es erneut zu versuchen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se interrumpió. Reinícialo para volver a intentarlo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawが中断されました。再起動してもう一度お試しください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 중단되었습니다. 다시 시도하려면 재시작하세요."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw a été interrompu. Redémarrez pour réessayer."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw बाधित हो गया था। फिर से कोशिश करने के लिए रीस्टार्ट करें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"توقف OpenClaw. أعد التشغيل للمحاولة مرة أخرى."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw è stato interrotto. Riavvia per riprovare."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kesintiye uğradı. Tekrar denemek için yeniden başlatın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Роботу OpenClaw було перервано. Перезапустіть, щоб повторити спробу."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw terhenti. Mulai ulang untuk mencoba lagi."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Działanie OpenClaw zostało przerwane. Uruchom ponownie, aby spróbować jeszcze raz."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw ถูกขัดจังหวะ เริ่มใหม่เพื่อลองอีกครั้ง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw đã bị gián đoạn. Hãy khởi động lại để thử lần nữa."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw is onderbroken. Start opnieuw om het nogmaals te proberen."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw متوقف شد. برای تلاش دوباره، راه‌اندازی مجدد کنید."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Работа OpenClaw была прервана. Перезапустите, чтобы повторить попытку."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw avbröts. Starta om för att försöka igen."}}}},
    "OpenClaw will check again before changing any inference settings.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw will check again before changing any inference settings."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 会在更改任何推理设置之前再次检查。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 會在變更任何推論設定前再次檢查。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw verificará novamente antes de alterar qualquer configuração de inferência."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw prüft erneut, bevor Inferenzeinstellungen geändert werden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw volverá a comprobar antes de cambiar cualquier ajuste de inferencia."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClawは推論設定を変更する前に再度確認します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw는 추론 설정을 변경하기 전에 다시 확인합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw vérifiera à nouveau avant de modifier les paramètres d'inférence."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"किसी भी inference सेटिंग को बदलने से पहले OpenClaw फिर से जाँच करेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سيتحقق OpenClaw مرة أخرى قبل تغيير أي من إعدادات الاستدلال."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw verificherà di nuovo prima di modificare qualsiasi impostazione di inferenza."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, herhangi bir çıkarım ayarını değiştirmeden önce tekrar denetleyecek."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw перевірить ще раз перед зміною будь-яких налаштувань висновування."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw akan memeriksa lagi sebelum mengubah pengaturan inferensi apa pun."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sprawdzi ponownie przed zmianą jakichkolwiek ustawień wnioskowania."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw จะตรวจสอบอีกครั้งก่อนเปลี่ยนการตั้งค่าการอนุมานใดๆ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sẽ kiểm tra lại trước khi thay đổi bất kỳ cài đặt suy luận nào."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw controleert opnieuw voordat er inferentie-instellingen worden gewijzigd."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw پیش از تغییر هر تنظیم استنتاج دوباره بررسی می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw проверит снова перед изменением любых настроек вывода."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kontrollerar igen innan några inferensinställningar ändras."}}}},
    "OpenClaw will copy itself to Applications and reopen there so updates and launch at login stay reliable.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw will copy itself to Applications and reopen there so updates and launch at login stay reliable."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 会将自身复制到“应用程序”并从那里重新打开，以确保更新和登录时启动保持可靠。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 會將自身複製到「應用程式」並在該處重新開啟，以確保更新與登入時啟動維持穩定。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw se copiará para Aplicativos e reabrirá de lá para que as atualizações e a inicialização no login permaneçam confiáveis."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kopiert sich selbst in den Ordner „Programme“ und öffnet sich dort erneut, damit Updates und der Start beim Anmelden zuverlässig funktionieren."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw se copiará en Aplicaciones y se reabrirá allí para que las actualizaciones y el inicio de sesión sigan siendo fiables."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は自身を Applications にコピーし、そこで再起動します。これにより更新とログイン時の起動が確実に機能します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw가 자신을 응용 프로그램에 복사하고 그곳에서 다시 열어 업데이트와 로그인 시 실행이 안정적으로 유지됩니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw va se copier dans Applications et se rouvrir depuis cet emplacement pour garantir la fiabilité des mises à jour et du lancement à l’ouverture de session."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw खुद को Applications में कॉपी करेगा और वहां से फिर से खुलेगा ताकि अपडेट और लॉगिन पर लॉन्च विश्वसनीय बने रहें।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سيقوم OpenClaw بنسخ نفسه إلى التطبيقات وإعادة الفتح هناك للحفاظ على موثوقية التحديثات والتشغيل عند تسجيل الدخول."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw si copierà in Applicazioni e si riaprirà lì affinché gli aggiornamenti e l'avvio al login rimangano affidabili."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kendini Applications klasörüne kopyalayacak ve orada yeniden açılacak, böylece güncellemeler ve oturum açıldığında başlatma güvenilir kalır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw скопіює себе в Applications і повторно відкриється там, щоб оновлення та запуск при вході залишалися надійними."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw akan menyalin dirinya ke Applications dan membuka kembali di sana agar pembaruan dan peluncuran saat login tetap andal."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw skopiuje się do folderu Aplikacje i otworzy się ponownie stamtąd, aby aktualizacje i uruchamianie przy logowaniu działały niezawodnie."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw จะคัดลอกตัวเองไปยัง Applications และเปิดใหม่ที่นั่น เพื่อให้การอัปเดตและการเปิดตอนเข้าสู่ระบบทำงานได้อย่างเสถียร"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sẽ tự sao chép vào Applications và mở lại ở đó để việc cập nhật và khởi chạy khi đăng nhập luôn ổn định."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kopieert zichzelf naar Programma's en opent daar opnieuw, zodat updates en starten bij aanmelden betrouwbaar blijven."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw خود را در Applications کپی می‌کند و از آنجا دوباره باز می‌شود تا به‌روزرسانی‌ها و اجرا هنگام ورود قابل‌اعتماد بمانند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw скопирует себя в Applications и снова откроется оттуда, чтобы обновления и запуск при входе работали надёжно."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw kopierar sig själv till Program och öppnas där igen så att uppdateringar och start vid inloggning förblir pålitliga."}}}},
    "OpenClaw will detect and verify the prepared model before using it.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw will detect and verify the prepared model before using it."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 会在使用前检测并验证已准备好的模型。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw 會在使用前偵測並驗證已準備的模型。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O OpenClaw detectará e verificará o modelo preparado antes de usá-lo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw erkennt und überprüft das vorbereitete Modell, bevor es verwendet wird."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw detectará y verificará el modelo preparado antes de usarlo."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw は使用する前に、準備されたモデルを検出して検証します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw는 준비된 모델을 사용하기 전에 이를 감지하고 검증합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw détectera et vérifiera le modèle préparé avant de l'utiliser."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw उपयोग करने से पहले तैयार किए गए मॉडल का पता लगाएगा और सत्यापित करेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سيكتشف OpenClaw النموذج المُجهّز ويتحقق منه قبل استخدامه."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw rileverà e verificherà il modello preparato prima di utilizzarlo."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw, hazırlanan modeli kullanmadan önce algılayıp doğrulayacaktır."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw виявить і перевірить підготовлену модель перед її використанням."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw akan mendeteksi dan memverifikasi model yang disiapkan sebelum menggunakannya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw wykryje i zweryfikuje przygotowany model przed jego użyciem."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw จะตรวจจับและตรวจสอบโมเดลที่เตรียมไว้ก่อนใช้งาน"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw sẽ phát hiện và xác minh mô hình đã chuẩn bị trước khi sử dụng."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw detecteert en verifieert het voorbereide model voordat het wordt gebruikt."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw قبل از استفاده، مدل آماده‌شده را شناسایی و تأیید می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw обнаружит и проверит подготовленную модель перед её использованием."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenClaw upptäcker och verifierar den förberedda modellen innan den används."}}}},
