    "Play short sounds when Talk Mode switches between listening, thinking, and speaking.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Play short sounds when Talk Mode switches between listening, thinking, and speaking."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当 Talk Mode 在聆听、思考和说话之间切换时播放短提示音。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"當 Talk Mode 在聆聽、思考與說話之間切換時播放短音效。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reproduza sons curtos quando o Modo de fala alternar entre escutar, pensar e falar."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kurze Töne abspielen, wenn der Talk Mode zwischen Zuhören, Denken und Sprechen wechselt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reproduce sonidos breves cuando el Modo Conversación cambia entre escuchar, pensar y hablar."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Talk Modeがリスニング、思考中、発話中の間で切り替わるときに短いサウンドを再生します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Talk Mode가 듣기, 생각 중, 말하기 사이를 전환할 때 짧은 소리를 재생합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lire de courts sons lorsque le Mode conversation passe de l’écoute à la réflexion, puis à la parole."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"जब Talk Mode सुनने, सोचने और बोलने के बीच स्विच करे, तो छोटी ध्वनियाँ चलाएँ।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تشغيل أصوات قصيرة عندما ينتقل وضع التحدث بين الاستماع والتفكير والتحدث."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Riproduci brevi suoni quando la modalità Talk passa tra ascolto, elaborazione e parlato."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Talk Mode dinleme, düşünme ve konuşma arasında geçiş yaptığında kısa sesler çalın."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Відтворювати короткі звуки, коли Talk Mode перемикається між прослуховуванням, обдумуванням і мовленням."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Putar suara singkat saat Talk Mode beralih antara mendengarkan, berpikir, dan berbicara."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odtwarzaj krótkie dźwięki, gdy tryb rozmowy przełącza się między słuchaniem, myśleniem i mówieniem."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"เล่นเสียงสั้น ๆ เมื่อ Talk Mode สลับระหว่างการฟัง การคิด และการพูด"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Phát âm thanh ngắn khi Chế độ trò chuyện chuyển đổi giữa nghe, suy nghĩ và nói."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Speel korte geluiden af wanneer Talk Mode schakelt tussen luisteren, denken en spreken."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنگام جابه‌جایی Talk Mode بین گوش دادن، فکر کردن و صحبت کردن، صداهای کوتاه پخش شود."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Воспроизводить короткие звуки, когда Talk Mode переключается между прослушиванием, обдумыванием и речью."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spela upp korta ljud när Talk Mode växlar mellan att lyssna, tänka och tala."}}}},
