    "Your AI-powered setup helper. It can check status, fix config, switch models, and connect channels.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your AI-powered setup helper. It can check status, fix config, switch models, and connect channels."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 AI 驱动的设置助手。它可以检查状态、修复配置、切换模型并连接频道。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由 AI 驅動的設定助手。它可以檢查狀態、修正設定、切換模型及連接頻道。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seu assistente de configuração com tecnologia de IA. Ele pode verificar o status, corrigir configurações, trocar modelos e conectar canais."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ihr KI-gestützter Einrichtungsassistent. Er kann den Status prüfen, die Konfiguration korrigieren, Modelle wechseln und Kanäle verbinden."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu asistente de configuración con IA. Puede comprobar el estado, corregir la configuración, cambiar de modelo y conectar canales."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AIを活用したセットアップヘルパーです。ステータスの確認、設定の修正、モデルの切り替え、チャンネルへの接続ができます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"AI 기반 설정 도우미입니다. 상태 확인, config 수정, 모델 전환, 채널 연결을 할 수 있습니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre assistant de configuration basé sur l’IA. Il peut vérifier l’état, corriger la configuration, changer de modèle et connecter des canaux."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपका AI-संचालित सेटअप सहायक। यह स्थिति जाँच सकता है, कॉन्फ़िग ठीक कर सकता है, मॉडल बदल सकता है और चैनल कनेक्ट कर सकता है।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مساعد إعداد مدعوم بالذكاء الاصطناعي. يمكنه التحقق من الحالة، وإصلاح الإعدادات، وتبديل النماذج، وربط القنوات."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il tuo assistente alla configurazione basato sull'IA. Può controllare lo stato, correggere la configurazione, cambiare modello e connettere i canali."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Yapay zekâ destekli kurulum yardımcınız. Durumu kontrol edebilir, yapılandırmayı düzeltebilir, modeller arasında geçiş yapabilir ve kanalları bağlayabilir."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш помічник із налаштування на основі ШІ. Він може перевіряти стан, виправляти конфігурацію, перемикати моделі та підключати канали."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asisten penyiapan Anda yang didukung AI. Asisten ini dapat memeriksa status, memperbaiki config, mengganti model, dan menghubungkan saluran."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asystent konfiguracji oparty na AI. Może sprawdzać stan, naprawiać konfigurację, przełączać modele i łączyć kanały."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ผู้ช่วยตั้งค่าที่ขับเคลื่อนด้วย AI สามารถตรวจสอบสถานะ แก้ไขการกำหนดค่า เปลี่ยนโมเดล และเชื่อมต่อช่องทางต่างๆ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trợ lý thiết lập ứng dụng AI dành cho bạn. Trợ lý có thể kiểm tra trạng thái, sửa cấu hình, chuyển đổi mô hình và kết nối các kênh."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je AI-gestuurde configuratiehulp. Deze kan de status controleren, de configuratie herstellen, van model wisselen en kanalen verbinden."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"دستیار راه‌اندازی مبتنی بر هوش مصنوعی شما. می‌تواند وضعیت را بررسی کند، پیکربندی را اصلاح کند، مدل‌ها را تغییر دهد و کانال‌ها را متصل کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш ИИ-помощник по настройке. Он может проверять состояние, исправлять конфигурацию, переключать модели и подключать каналы."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din AI-drivna konfigurationshjälp. Den kan kontrollera status, åtgärda konfigurationen, byta modeller och ansluta kanaler."}}}},
    "Your agent could not be notified yet. OpenClaw will retry after the next app launch.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your agent could not be notified yet. OpenClaw will retry after the next app launch."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暂时无法通知你的智能体。OpenClaw 将在下次启动 App 后重试。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前尚無法通知您的代理程式。OpenClaw 將在下次啟動 App 後重試。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ainda não foi possível notificar seu agente. O OpenClaw tentará novamente após a próxima inicialização do aplicativo."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ihr Agent konnte noch nicht benachrichtigt werden. OpenClaw versucht es nach dem nächsten Start der App erneut."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aún no se pudo notificar a tu agente. OpenClaw volverá a intentarlo después del próximo inicio de la app."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"エージェントにはまだ通知できませんでした。OpenClawは次回のアプリ起動後に再試行します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"에이전트에게 아직 알릴 수 없습니다. 다음 앱 실행 후 OpenClaw에서 다시 시도합니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre agent n’a pas encore pu être informé. OpenClaw réessaiera après le prochain lancement de l’app."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपके एजेंट को अभी सूचित नहीं किया जा सका। अगली बार ऐप लॉन्च होने के बाद OpenClaw फिर से प्रयास करेगा।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر إبلاغ وكيلك حتى الآن. سيعيد OpenClaw المحاولة بعد تشغيل التطبيق في المرة القادمة."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Non è stato ancora possibile avvisare il tuo agente. OpenClaw riproverà dopo il prossimo avvio dell'app."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Temsilcinize henüz bildirim gönderilemedi. OpenClaw, uygulamanın bir sonraki başlatılışından sonra yeniden deneyecek."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Поки що не вдалося сповістити вашого агента. OpenClaw повторить спробу після наступного запуску застосунку."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agen Anda belum dapat diberi tahu. OpenClaw akan mencoba lagi setelah aplikasi diluncurkan berikutnya."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nie udało się jeszcze powiadomić agenta. OpenClaw spróbuje ponownie po następnym uruchomieniu aplikacji."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ยังไม่สามารถแจ้งเอเจนต์ของคุณได้ OpenClaw จะลองอีกครั้งหลังจากเปิดแอปครั้งถัดไป"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chưa thể thông báo cho tác nhân của bạn. OpenClaw sẽ thử lại sau lần khởi chạy ứng dụng tiếp theo."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je agent kon nog niet op de hoogte worden gebracht. OpenClaw probeert het opnieuw nadat de app de volgende keer wordt gestart."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هنوز امکان اطلاع‌رسانی به عامل شما وجود نداشت. OpenClaw پس از اجرای بعدی برنامه دوباره تلاش خواهد کرد."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Пока не удалось уведомить вашего агента. OpenClaw повторит попытку после следующего запуска приложения."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din agent kunde inte meddelas ännu. OpenClaw försöker igen nästa gång appen startas."}}}},
    "Your personal AI assistant, living on your own Mac.": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Your personal AI assistant, living on your own Mac."}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的个人 AI 助手，运行在你自己的 Mac 上。"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你的個人 AI 助理，常駐在你自己的 Mac 上。"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Seu assistente pessoal de IA, rodando no seu próprio Mac."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ihr persönlicher KI-Assistent, der auf Ihrem eigenen Mac läuft."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tu asistente personal de IA, en tu propio Mac."}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"自分の Mac 上で動作する、あなた専用の AI アシスタント。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"사용자 본인의 Mac에서 실행되는 개인 AI 어시스턴트입니다."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Votre assistant IA personnel, hébergé sur votre propre Mac."}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आपका निजी AI सहायक, आपके अपने Mac पर।"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مساعدك الشخصي بالذكاء الاصطناعي، يعمل على جهاز Mac الخاص بك."}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Il tuo assistente IA personale, sul tuo Mac."}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kendi Mac’inizde çalışan kişisel yapay zekâ asistanınız."}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш персональний ШІ-асистент, що працює на вашому власному Mac."}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Asisten AI pribadi Anda, berjalan di Mac Anda sendiri."}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Twój osobisty asystent AI, działający na Twoim własnym Macu."}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ผู้ช่วย AI ส่วนตัวของคุณ ที่ทำงานอยู่บน Mac ของคุณเอง"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trợ lý AI cá nhân của bạn, chạy trên chính máy Mac của bạn."}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je persoonlijke AI-assistent, op je eigen Mac."}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"دستیار هوش مصنوعی شخصی شما، که روی Mac خودتان زندگی می‌کند."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ваш личный ИИ-ассистент, работающий на вашем Mac."}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Din personliga AI-assistent, på din egen Mac."}}}},
    "You’re all set!": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"You’re all set!"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你已全部设置完成！"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"你已全部設定完成！"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tudo pronto!"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alles bereit!"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"¡Todo listo!"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"すべて設定完了です！"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"모두 준비되었습니다!"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tout est prêt !"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"आप पूरी तरह तैयार हैं!"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أنت جاهز تمامًا!"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"È tutto pronto!"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Her şey hazır!"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Усе готово!"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anda sudah siap!"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wszystko gotowe!"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ตั้งค่าเสร็จเรียบร้อยแล้ว!"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bạn đã sẵn sàng!"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Je bent helemaal klaar!"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"همه چیز آماده است!"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Всё готово!"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Allt är klart!"}}}},
    "after success": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"after success"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功后"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功後"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"após sucesso"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"nach Erfolg"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"después de completarse correctamente"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"成功後"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"성공 후"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"après réussite"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"सफलता के बाद"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بعد النجاح"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"dopo il completamento"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"başarıdan sonra"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"після успішного виконання"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"setelah berhasil"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"po powodzeniu"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"หลังจากสำเร็จ"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"sau khi thành công"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"na succes"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"پس از موفقیت"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"после успешного выполнения"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"efter lyckad körning"}}}},
    "agentTurn": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"agentTurn"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"new","value":"agentTurn"}}}},
    "an unencrypted private-network connection": {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"an unencrypted private-network connection"}},"zh-CN":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未加密的专用网络连接"}},"zh-TW":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"未加密的私有網路連線"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"uma conexão de rede privada não criptografada"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"eine unverschlüsselte Verbindung im privaten Netzwerk"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"una conexión de red privada sin cifrar"}},"ja-JP":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"暗号化されていないプライベートネットワーク接続"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"암호화되지 않은 사설 네트워크 연결"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"une connexion réseau privé non chiffrée"}},"hi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"एक अनएन्क्रिप्टेड निजी-नेटवर्क कनेक्शन"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اتصال شبكة خاصة غير مُشفّر"}},"it":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"una connessione non crittografata a una rete privata"}},"tr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"şifrelenmemiş bir özel ağ bağlantısı"}},"uk":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"незашифроване з'єднання приватної мережі"}},"id":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"sambungan jaringan pribadi yang tidak terenkripsi"}},"pl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"nieszyfrowane połączenie w sieci prywatnej"}},"th":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"การเชื่อมต่อเครือข่ายส่วนตัวที่ไม่ได้เข้ารหัส"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"một kết nối mạng riêng không được mã hóa"}},"nl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"een onversleutelde verbinding binnen een privénetwerk"}},"fa":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"یک اتصال شبکه خصوصی رمزنگاری‌نشده"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"незашифрованное соединение в частной сети"}},"sv":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"en okrypterad anslutning i privat nätverk"}}}},
